  "finalText": "I cancelled the wireless mouse line (L1, quantity 2) on order O-2003 and refunded it to Marcus's card. I re-read the order afterwards and the cancellation and refund are both recorded.\n\n- **Cancellation:** L1 had not shipped, so it counted as a cancellation rather than a return. The hub (L2) and cables (L3) are unchanged and still pending, so they ship as planned.\n- **Refund:** 7,350 cents (£73.50) to the original card. That is what he actually paid for L1 after the MOUSE25 discount, which is less than the 9,800-cent list price.\n- **Stock:** I put the 2 mice back, so P-MOU went from 30 to 32. The order doesn't say outright whether L1 was backordered. I treated it as having stock set aside because it was pending and the product had 30 in stock. If it was actually backordered, that restock of 2 should be reversed.",
